To run SimpsonsRule.java  do the following in terminal which has these files in current directory  ----->

    Enter -> javac SimpsonsRule.java    
    Next -> java SimpsonsRule <NoofThread>    

    eg. javac SimpsonsRule.java
        java SimpsonsRule 5
    
    NoofThread  >=4 && <=16
    Output ---> output will be time taken to execute and value of integration with n=1000002  equal partitions  using given no of threads .











To run Matrix_Multiplication.java  do the following in terminal which has these files in current directory  ----->

    Enter -> javac Matrix_Multiplication.java    
    Next -> java Matrix_Multiplication <NoofThread>    

    eg. javac Matrix_Multiplication.java
        java Matrix_Multiplication 10 

    Output ---> output will be time taken to execute matrix multiplication with size N=1000 using given no of threads .
